---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="BOEC Accessible Stargazing RSVP | Breck Sky Fest" description="RSVP for public accessible stargazing with BOEC on November 11, 2026. Evening time and location To Be Announced.">
<PageIntro eyebrow="Public accessible stargazing" title="RSVP for accessible stargazing." description="Wednesday, November 11, 2026 · Evening time and location: To Be Announced." icon="stars"/>
<section class="section paper-section"><div class="wrap"><p>This public evening program prioritizes community members and their families who need increased accessibility. RSVP to help us plan equipment and accessibility arrangements, and contact you with program details and important weather updates. Most community members are encouraged to choose the free Frisco program on November 27 or the main Breck program on November 28. This form is for evening stargazing, not the private 1 PM BOEC student session.</p><form class="rsvp-form" id="boec-rsvp" action="/api/rsvp" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="event" value="boec"/><label for="attendee-name">Attendee name</label><input id="attendee-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required/><label for="attendee-email">Email address</label><input id="attendee-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/><label for="attendee-phone">Phone number (optional)</label><input id="attendee-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="50" aria-describedby="phone-help"/><p id="phone-help" style="font-size:1rem">Provide a number where the festival team can reach you about this event or important weather updates.</p><label for="attendee-count">Number of people attending (including you)</label><input id="attendee-count" type="number" inputmode="numeric" name="people" min="1" max="500" step="1" value="1" required/><label for="accessibility-needs">Accessibility needs (optional)</label><p id="accessibility-help">Tell us about any access arrangements that would help you or your family take part. Share only what you are comfortable sharing; a medical diagnosis is not needed. The festival team will use this information to plan and follow up with you.</p><textarea id="accessibility-needs" name="accessibility" rows="5" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="accessibility-help"></textarea><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this blank</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:20px;font-size:1rem">Your name, email, phone number if provided, group size, and any accessibility needs you choose to share will be stored by the festival team for attendance planning and updates about this event.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Submit stargazing RSVP</button><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><div class="rsvp-confirmation" id="rsvp-confirmation" tabindex="-1" hidden><h2>You’re on the list.</h2><p>Your RSVP has been saved for public accessible stargazing with BOEC on Wednesday, November 11, 2026.</p><p>The evening time and location are still To Be Announced. We’ll use your email for confirmed details, accessibility follow-up, and important weather updates.</p><p id="rsvp-reference"></p><a class="text-link" href="/program/accessible-astronomy-boec/">Back to event details</a></div><p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="text-link" href="/program/accessible-astronomy-boec/">See the full event details</a></p></div></section>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#boec-rsvp');
form?.addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;const status=form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.form-status')!;button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Saving your RSVP…';try{const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form),headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.');form.hidden=true;const confirmation=document.getElementById('rsvp-confirmation')!;document.getElementById('rsvp-reference')!.textContent=`RSVP reference: ${result.id}`;confirmation.hidden=false;confirmation.focus();}catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Unable to save your RSVP. Please try again.';}finally{button.disabled=false;}});
</script>
</Layout>
